---
source: tests/snapshots_help_contracts.rs
expression: "help(&scratch, None, &[\"--help\"])"
---
phasegent [VERSION]

Provider-backed workflow CLI (all roles).

Usage:
  phasegent [GLOBAL OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [ARGS]
  phasegent gui

Role resolution:
  Managed sessions supply the role; other hosts set PHASEGENT_ROLE.

Options:
  --provider <NAME>      forgejo, redmine, gitlab, or local (default: forgejo)
  --api-base <URL>       Override the provider API base
  --repository <O/R>     Override the Forgejo owner/repository
  --project-id <ID>      Override the Redmine or GitLab project id
  --close-status-id <ID> Override the Redmine closed status
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version

Commands:
  gui                    Open the desktop GUI (single-binary shell)
  issue                  Issue operations
  comment                Comment operations
  admin                  Human-operator provisioning: auth setup, config writes, workflow bootstrap (AI roles must never invoke)
  config                 Local configuration (read-only show/get; writes live under admin)
  doctor                 Read-only self-check: credential presence, index backend, masked PG URL (no role needed)
  hooks                  Managed Git hook installation
  notify                 Bounded agent notifications
  mcp                    MCP server over stdio or streamable HTTP
  plugin                 Managed OpenCode plugin installation
  repo                   Repository operations
  worktree               Local per-(repo, issue, session) worktree leases (acquire/release/prune orchestrator-only; status/list readable by orchestrator, executor, reviewer)

Use 'phasegent --help <command>' for the next level.
Provider resolution chain and machine-wide default: 'phasegent --help config provider'.
Role and credential guidance: 'phasegent --help admin'.
